    "Names match whole words, ignoring case, so 'IU' does not match 'Liu Yifei'.",
    "Avoid names that are ordinary words or shared by several artists: a group",
    "joins everyone it matches. Add your own groups under \"aliases\" in your",
    "config.json; they are added to these, and groups sharing a name are merged.",
    "Keys starting with an underscore are comments."
